Failed: describe: the step is "parsed", "settled", "types", "module", or "tmpl"
interactive#9: fail

=== the module renames names declared again
let x = 1
let x = x + 1
let x = x * 10
class P(public a: Int) {}
let p = new P(x)
class P(public b: String) {}
new P("${p.a}")
describe(6, "module")
describe(4, "module")
